# Daily Cash Tally — credentials & setup checklist
#
# workflow.json contains no credential blocks and no $env references —
# n8n credentials live in the n8n app, not in env vars. This file ENUMERATES
# the services to connect before going live. Every value is empty or an
# obvious placeholder; nothing here is a real secret.
#
# LIVE/DEMO SWITCH: there is no env flag in this workflow. All nine
# service nodes ship "disabled": true — that is the isolation mechanism.
# The manual demo lane ("When clicking 'Test workflow'" → "Demo till log
# (entries + history)") runs end-to-end with zero credentials.
# To go live: enable the greyed-out nodes in the n8n editor, attach the
# credentials below, and remove the demo intake node so "Read today's till
# entries" + "Read prior-30d till log" feed the merge instead.

# --- Google Sheets ×4 ---
# n8n credential type: Google Sheets OAuth2 (googleSheetsOAuth2Api)
# Nodes: Read today's till entries · Read prior-30d till log ·
#        Append verdict to till log · Park row in quarantine
# In each node, pick your till-log spreadsheet and the matching tab.
# Expected tabs: today, history, results, quarantine.
# Row shape the Reconcile node consumes:
#   date (YYYY-MM-DD), shift, staff, expected_sales, counted_cash
GOOGLE_SHEETS_DOC_ID=

# --- Gmail ×1 ---
# n8n credential type: Gmail OAuth2 (gmailOAuth2)
# Node: Email owner alert — first-offense alerts and submission-gap alerts.
# Replace the sendTo placeholder (currently owner@example.com) with the
# owner's real address.
GMAIL_OWNER_EMAIL=owner@example.com

# --- Telegram ×2 ---
# n8n credential type: Telegram API (telegramApi) — a bot token from
# @BotFather.
# Nodes: Escalation ping (repeat-offender alerts) · Send daily digest
# Both take a chatId parameter that ships as the placeholder
# "your_chat_id" — replace it with your real chat ID.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id

# --- OpenAI ×2 (optional) ---
# n8n credential type: OpenAI (openAiApi) — API key.
# Nodes: Optional AI: phrase owner alert · Optional AI: narrate daily
#        digest (model: gpt-4o-mini)
# Optional — verdicts are deterministic without them; enabling only changes
# phrasing. When enabling, remap the downstream message fields per the
# notes on each node.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
